<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57 (FIM 258.64).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57 (FIM 258.64).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR fell $1-1/2 to $57 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 258.64 markka. In Helsinki on Friday Nokia A closed up 7.70 markka at 256.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed unchanged at $32 on Wall Street. The price equals about 72.60 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.80 markka at 72.80.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR fell $0-1/8 to $18-3/4 in New York on Friday. The price equals about 85.08 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 1.50 markka at 86.50.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
